%N A398249 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} H(k,2) / 2^k, where H(k,2) = A007406(k)/A007407(k) is the k-th generalized harmonic number of order 2.
%H A398249 Michael I. Shamos, <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20220206102634/https://citeseerx.ist.psu.edu/viewdoc/download?doi=10.1.1.366.9997&amp;rep=rep1&amp;type=pdf">A catalog of the real numbers</a>, 2011. See p. 226.
%H A398249 <a href="/index/Ha#harmonic">Index entries for sequences related to harmonic numbers</a>.
%F A398249 Equals Pi^2/6 - log(2)^2 = zeta(2) - log(2)^2 = A013661 - A253191.
%F A398249 Equals 2 * Li_2(1/2) = 2 * A076788.
%e A398249 1.164481052930025011805312640319360217488396949612252...
%t A398249 RealDigits[Zeta[2] - Log[2]^2, 10, 120][[1]]
%o A398249 (PARI) zeta(2) - log(2)^2
%Y A398249 Cf. A007406, A007407.
%Y A398249 Cf. A002162, A013661, A076788, A253191.
